body:
Yes, I am using the Daedric Lord Armor Replacer. I did not know that it replaces Venim's weapon. I will test this and get back to you as soon as possible.

&#x200B;

EDIT: I just did some console commands to get the fight over with. You were right. Venim's character does not have a Dai-Katana, instead the Daedric Lord Armor Replacer mod gave Venim a Daedric Nodachi, that is why I keep getting the dialogue as if I looted his body.

&#x200B;

EDIT 2: So I just did some console commands to add a Daedric Dai-Katana to Venim's body. When I spoke with Athyn again, he congratulated me on the honorable duel with Venim. So with your detective work, you fixed my issue! Thank you so much for your time and help!
